            "text": "正好 describes an exact fit or convenient coincidence in amount, timing or circumstance, not an approximate match.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这里正好有三个人。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ zhènghǎo yǒu sān gè rén 。",
                "meaning": "There are exactly three people here.",
                "audio": "72244c6a8e38e3a874426d5a472aaa8f7a04e9f46898e026b7782fd051f80567"
              },
              {
                "text": "你来得正好。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ lái de zhènghǎo 。",
